    "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/4/4c/Lobrydaqbulb.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20240506021612\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Lobrydaqbulb\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/4/4c/Lobrydaqbulb.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/400?cb=20240506021612\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"400\" height=\"921\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Lobrydaqbulb.jpg\" data-image-key=\"Lobrydaqbulb.jpg\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a></span>\n</p><p><b>恶魔的木偶</b>\n</p><p>一位美丽的战士兼寻宝者，在打破一道遗物封印后，被来自魔界的邪恶之手所操控。她以十字弩展现出诡谲多变的战斗风格。\n\n</p><p><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/2/2a/SLobrydaqbulb.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20240506021610\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"SLobrydaqbulb\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/2/2a/SLobrydaqbulb.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/400?cb=20240506021610\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"400\" height=\"1035\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"SLobrydaqbulb.jpg\" data-image-key=\"SLobrydaqbulb.jpg\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a></span>\n<span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/c/c0/Lobryda_DM_Circus_Queen%27s_Blade_Unlimited_Limit_Break_.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20260120000403\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Lobryda DM Circus Queen&#39;s Blade Unlimited Limit Break \" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/c/c0/Lobryda_DM_Circus_Queen%27s_Blade_Unlimited_Limit_Break_.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/400?cb=20260120000403\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"400\" height=\"842\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Lobryda DM Circus Queen&#39;s Blade Unlimited Limit Break .jpg\" data-image-key=\"Lobryda_DM_Circus_Queen%27s_Blade_Unlimited